Cell["\<\
We chose to use the fourth of our preliminary models to parameterize the \
CoRoL, as it had low errors and fit both high and low magnitudes well.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9960839875309176`*^9, 
  3.9960840340927095`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e282c03a-1c69-41f5-93da-\
c4a12a9bfb47"],

